00:00:00,422 --> 00:00:04,592
"Hey, we found a bug"
and report it, so it can be fixed.

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,680
(Penny:)You mean like a beta test?

3
00:00:08,013 --> 00:00:09,973
(Leonard:)Technically, this would be an alpha test.

4
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:13,310
(Leonard:)A beta test requires people that
weren't involved in the develop...

5
00:00:13,477 --> 00:00:16,317
Seriously? Do I not get credit
for knowing beta test?

6
00:00:17,648 --> 00:00:20,438
(Leonard:)No, you should. Absolutely.
That was me being pedantic.

7
